      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Coronary artery stent implantation is used increasingly to treat restenosis after balloon angioplasty. This study demonstrates that a short interprocedural interval, between initial angioplasty and stent implantation, is a significant risk factor for in-stent restenosis."},
